  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1021/839/simple_recipes.png\" alt=\"simple_recipes.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這是一個簡單的模組，為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力模組（Create mod）</a>新增合成配方！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前已新增的配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>2個燧石、玄武岩和250毫升岩漿可合成未完成的凝灰岩</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_771fe75e-1ed5-4e72-bf69-3873efaa497e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>沖洗未完成的凝灰岩可獲得凝灰岩</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_369a9d0d-40ee-46f0-a85e-4dead8419335.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>粉碎海磷石可獲得鋅</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_d2c4af2c-ae8f-4b2e-8a67-8be4519a97e9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在石灰岩上噴注400毫升岩漿可獲得青金石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_c385803a-78f2-4726-bf3f-921ba5a9425f.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>任何鋤頭均可將粗土轉化為泥土</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_a3ad7e82-fcf4-4c5f-98fc-56dc9e51d89f.png\"></p>\n<p>附魔黏液球可轉化為蜘蛛眼</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1106541/description_343f5fb7-3f6e-4230-baca-2bcd29b254ae.png\"></p>\n</div>",
